pageType: content
notes: |
  Triple product milestone slide. Integrates a publication-grade chart tracking the Lawson triple product (n * T * tau_E) from 1968 to 2025. Highlights the 10,000-fold progress from early Soviet T-3 experiments through JET DT campaigns and NIF inertial ignition. Sets up the current transition from public national laboratories to private HTS-driven ventures (CFS, Energy Singularity).
elements:
  # Header Kicker
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 26, 600, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "01 · SCIENTIFIC BASIS"

  # Header Title
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 42, 860, 30]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: "Confinement Performance Grew 10,000-Fold; Private Ventures Now Target Commercial Ignition Territory"

  # Header Subtitle
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 72, 860, 16]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: "60-year trajectory of the fusion triple product against the Lawson ignition boundary (1965–2030)"

  # Header Divider
  - elementId: header-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 92, 860, 1]
    points: "0,0 860,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  # Chart Image Left
  - elementId: chart-triple-product
    elementType: image
    bounds: [50, 104, 500, 358]
    src: "assets/chart_triple_product.png"
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  # Right Column - Analysis & Landmark Table
  - elementId: right-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [562, 104, 348, 358]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: right-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [562, 104, 348, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$titleNavy"}

  - elementId: right-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [572, 109, 328, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      text: "LANDMARK EXPERIMENTAL MILESTONES"

  - elementId: right-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [572, 138, 328, 316]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.2
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p><b>1968 · T-3 Tokamak (Kurchatov Institute, USSR):</b></p>
        <p>British diagnostic team verified core electron temperatures &gt;1 keV (~11M °C), establishing the tokamak as the dominant magnetic topology worldwide.</p>
        <p><br><b>1997 · JET DTE1 (Culham, UK):</b></p>
        <p>Achieved peak fusion power of 16.1 MW with \( Q_{\mathrm{plasma}} = 0.67 \) using 50:50 D-T fuel. Stood as the world power record for over two decades.</p>
        <p><br><b>2022 · NIF Target Ignition (LLNL, USA):</b></p>
        <p>Dec 5, 2022: Delivered 3.15 MJ fusion yield from 2.05 MJ UV laser input onto target capsule (\( Q = 1.54 \)), achieving first laboratory ignition in history.</p>
        <p><br><b>2023 · JET DTE3 Final Campaign (UKAEA):</b></p>
        <p>Sustained a record 69.3 MJ fusion energy over 5.2 seconds, confirming steady plasma-wall equilibrium in beryllium/tungsten environments.</p>
        <p><br><b>2026–2028 · The HTS Commercial Cohort:</b></p>
        <p>Commonwealth Fusion Systems (SPARC) and Energy Singularity target \( Q &gt; 2 \) in compact high-field tokamaks before 2028.</p>

  # Bottom Synthesis Strip
  - elementId: synth-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 472, 860, 32]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panelBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: synth-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 472, 4, 32]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accentBlue"}

  - elementId: synth-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 478, 836, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$ink"
      text: "<b>Historical Synthesis:</b> Confinement performance doubled every 1.8 years from 1970–1995 (outpacing Moore's law); the 2000–2020 pause ended with HTS high-field magnets."

  # Footer Line
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 514, 860, 1]
    points: "0,0 860,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.6, color: "$border"}

  # Footer Source Left
  - elementId: footer-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 518, 620, 15]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: "Source: IAEA Nuclear Fusion database; EUROfusion JET technical reports (2023); Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory (2022)."

  # Footer Page Right
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 518, 190, 15]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "Slide 04 / 16"
